<h3>Why 100% Declared‑Value Marine Transit Insurance Is Crucial</h3>
<p>When your vehicle travels by road from Gorakhpur to Delhi, it may pass through congested highways, rough terrains, or encounter unforeseen incidents. A <strong>100% declared‑value marine transit insurance</strong> guarantees that the insurer will cover the full market value of the car, regardless of damage or loss during transit. This level of coverage protects you against:</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Accidental collisions or road mishaps.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Theft or vandalism en route.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Natural calamities or infrastructure failures.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Losses due to negligence of the carrier or third parties.</span></li>
</ul>
<p>By opting for 100% declared‑value coverage, you eliminate the risk of having to pay out‑of‑pocket for repairs or replacement, ensuring peace of mind throughout the transport process.</p>

<h3>Step‑by‑Step Preparation Checklist</h3>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;">
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Verify that the RC, PUC, and insurance certificates are up‑to‑date and valid.</span></li>
<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Photocopy each document and have them self‑attested by the vehicle owner.</span></li>
