      <span style="background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12); color: #c084fc; border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.35); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px;">PRE-TRANSIT AUDIT</span>
      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Pre-Loading Inspection, Odometer Logging &amp; Photographic Audit for Transport from Gorakhpur Delhi</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Before a vehicle leaves for its destination, a meticulous pre‑loading protocol ensures safety, compliance, and customer confidence.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This process blends technology and hands‑on checks, covering everything from a 360‑degree digital condition audit to the management of FASTag devices.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Below is a concise checklist that any <strong>vehicle transport company in Madhapur</strong> or <strong>car transport services in Delhi</strong> can adopt to guarantee a flawless journey.</span></li></ul>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">360‑Degree Digital Condition Audit:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Use high‑resolution cameras and a mobile app to capture every angle of the car. Record exterior paint, undercarriage, wheels, and interior upholstery. Store images in a cloud‑based log that can be shared with packers and movers Delhi email sales for instant client updates.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Battery Terminal Checks:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Inspect the battery for corrosion, ensure terminals are tight, and clean any buildup with a mixture of baking soda and water. Document the battery’s voltage and load test results, especially for electric or hybrid models that require enclosed auto transport services to preserve battery health.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Fill the tank to exactly 25% of its capacity to reduce weight while preventing fuel spillage. Verify the fuel gauge and add a fuel additive to keep the engine primed. This step is crucial for automobile transport where long hauls can strain the engine.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag Management:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Remove or disable the FASTag before loading to avoid accidental toll charges. Re‑install it once the vehicle is secured and the route is confirmed. Keep a backup card in a secure pouch, especially when using Indian railway vehicle transport for inter‑city moves.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ec489922; color: #ec4899; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">05</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Final Safety &amp; Documentation Check:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Confirm that all safety straps, wheel locks, and spare parts are in place. Generate a digital manifest that includes the audit photos, battery report, fuel level, and FASTag status. Share this manifest with reliable movers and packers in Delhi and Sakshi Packers and Movers Delhi for seamless coordination.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p>By integrating these steps, your transport operation—whether handling <strong>car transport services in Delhi</strong> or providing <strong>enclosed auto transport services</strong>—will deliver peace of mind to clients and uphold the highest industry standards.</p></div>
